import PageHero from "../../components/PageHero.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Using the Kora preview." description="A demonstration of the planned commerce product, not an active merchant subscription.">
<PageHero eyebrow="Preview notice \u00b7 15 October 2026" title="Using the Kora preview." lede="A demonstration of the planned commerce product, not an active merchant subscription." />
<section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-14 prose-kora">
<h2>Sample functionality</h2>
<p>Animations and calculators illustrate workflows. They do not process real orders, hold inventory, verify payments or deliver receipt files.</p>
<h2>Pilot interest</h2>
<p>Submitting a local draft or sending an interest message does not create a merchant account. Access, scope, price and responsibilities must be agreed separately before a live pilot.</p>
<h2>Indicative pricing</h2>
<p>Displayed plan prices and annual comparisons are proposals. No checkout or subscription billing is available here. Savings calculations depend on the assumptions you enter.</p>
<h2>Before live trading</h2>
<p>Production service terms, operating entity, support arrangements and payment-provider onboarding must be confirmed before the system handles live business records.</p>
<p><a href="/pilot" class="btn btn-primary">Explore the founding pilot</a></p>
</section>
</BaseLayout>
